OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 600-home scheme 'lacks
OL,4,Ainfrastructure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has said a housebuilder's
OL,7,Faims to build a proposed 600-home
OL,8,Fscheme are "impossible" ahead of a
OL,9,Fpublic inquiry into the project.
OL,11,FIn March, Stockton Council's planning
OL,12,Fcommittee rejected Taylor Wimpey's
OL,13,F#133m proposal for land east of
OL,14,FHoldenfields Farm on Green Lane, Yarm.
OL,16,FBut the developers appealed against the
OL,17,Fdecision to the Planning Inspectorate
OL,18,Fand the body's public inquiry into the
OL,19,Fdecision, which is expected to last a
OL,20,Fweek, is set to begin on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
