OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 600-home scheme 'lacks
OL,4,Ainfrastructure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative councillor Andrew Sherris
OL,7,Fsaid there was a lack of electrical
OL,8,Fcapacity for the development. Taylor
OL,9,FWimpey said technical issues such as
OL,10,Fthis would be discussed at the inquiry.
